{
  "_": "THE keys and menu entries of the remote screen, for both remotes: the Phone app's native one (RemoteScreen.kt, PhoneRemote.kt) and the web one (js/remote.js; the Computer app, the TV web page). Add, reorder or rename here and both change. Words: 't' is an id in i18n/<lang>.json (rkey.*), 'sub' the id of the small line under a menu entry. 'phone' / 'web' override fields for that side only, with the reason in 'why'. 'cores': [\"phone\"] or [\"web\"], only that side shows the entry. An entry is either a key ('key': a name from Scenes.KEYS / the /api/key names) or an action ('do': a handler name, 'arg' passed to it); every 'do' needs a handler on both sides (app/shared/tests/remote.test.js and RemoteSpecTest.kt check it). A menu entry may carry 'when' (a condition the handler supplies) or be 'expand' (the handler supplies several entries there). 'needs': what the TV must be able to do (Remote.Kind.caps: adb, store, link, app_list...); on an LG or Samsung TV that lacks one a row key is greyed and a menu entry left out. Icons: dev/gen_icons.py. The top row (power, speak, keyboard, more), the arrows, the number keys and the volume / channel bars are laid out by hand on each side.",
  "rows": {
    "more": [
      [
        { "id": "open", "icon": "send", "t": "rkey.open", "do": "open" },
        { "id": "input", "icon": "input", "t": "rkey.input", "do": "inputs" },
        { "id": "subtitles", "icon": "subtitle", "t": "rkey.subtitles", "key": "SUBTITLE" },
        { "id": "timer", "icon": "timer", "t": "rkey.timer", "do": "timer", "needs": ["screen_off"] }
      ],
      [
        { "id": "settings", "icon": "settings", "t": "rkey.settings", "key": "SETTINGS" },
        { "id": "scenes", "icon": "scene", "t": "rkey.scenes", "do": "scenes" },
        { "id": "screenshot", "icon": "camera", "t": "rkey.screenshot", "do": "shot", "needs": ["adb"] },
        { "id": "share", "icon": "share", "t": "rkey.share", "do": "share", "needs": ["adb"] }
      ],
      [
        { "id": "info", "icon": "info", "t": "rkey.info", "key": "INFO" },
        { "id": "stop", "icon": "stop", "t": "rkey.stop", "key": "STOP" },
